[TITLE]
Skeleton network approximating the Potable Water Pumping Station example so the
stand-alone operating point and EPANET's own solve can be compared.
  static lift        24 m   (SUMP 8 m  ->  RM_END 32 m)
  suction path       35 m of DN700, K 4.85, aged roughness 0.30 mm
  discharge path    515 m of DN400, K 8.20, aged roughness 0.30 mm
Run:  pumpsizer run potable_water_pumping_station.yaml --into net.inp --simulate

[JUNCTIONS]
 PUMP_IN         8    0
 PUMP_OUT        8    0

[RESERVOIRS]
 SUMP            8
 RM_END          32

[PIPES]
 SUCTION         SUMP       PUMP_IN    35    704.4   0.30   4.85   Open
 RISING_MAIN     PUMP_OUT   RM_END     515   402.8   0.30   8.20   Open

[PUMPS]
 PMP1            PUMP_IN    PUMP_OUT   HEAD C_PLACEHOLDER

[CURVES]
 C_PLACEHOLDER   0     45
 C_PLACEHOLDER   300   35
 C_PLACEHOLDER   600   8

[OPTIONS]
 UNITS           LPS
 HEADLOSS        D-W

[TIMES]
 DURATION        0

[REPORT]
 STATUS          NO

[END]
